  "body": "Positioned right in the heart of vibrant Takapuna, this architecturally designed three-level residence offers an exceptional combination of generous proportions, modern comfort, and an incredibly convenient lifestyle — all within moments of cafes, restaurants, shopping, beautiful Takapuna Beach, and excellent transport links.\r\n\r\nOffering approximately 172m² of thoughtfully designed living, this home stands out as a rare offering in central Takapuna, where genuine scale is becoming increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, you are welcomed by a spacious bedroom complete with its own ensuite — an ideal setup for guests, teenagers, extended family, or working from home — alongside the convenience of an internal access single garage.\r\n\r\nHead upstairs and you will immediately appreciate the impressive sense of space created by the striking high-stud ceilings. The light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area forms the true heart of the home, seamlessly flowing out to a generous sun-soaked balcony that creates excellent indoor-outdoor flow for entertaining or everyday living. A guest powder room on this level adds further practicality and convenience.\r\n\r\nThe upper floor is thoughtfully configured for family living, featuring three bedrooms plus a versatile study/fourth bedroom currently used as a study, including a spacious master suite complete with its own ensuite, while the remaining rooms are serviced by a beautifully appointed family bathroom. From this level, enjoy elevated outlooks capturing glimpses of the sea together with views towards the Sky Tower — a reminder of just how centrally positioned this home truly is.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of this property is the convenience of its one-way driveway access, with entry via Anzac Street and exit onto Lomond Street, providing easy access and added convenience in this premium central location.\r\n\r\nCompleted with modern finishes and presented in excellent condition, this is a home that offers all the benefits of contemporary living without compromising on space or functionality. Whether you are searching for a premium lock-and-leave, a family home, or an easy-care lifestyle in one of Auckland’s most sought-after coastal suburbs, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nEnjoy added peace of mind, with the balance of the 10-Year Master Build Guarantee transferable to the new owner.\r\n\r\nWith so much to offer, this type of property in such a premium location is a rare find. Early inspection is highly recommended. Call now.",
